msgstr "[`Counter(values)`](https://docs.python.org/3/library/collections.html#collections.Counter) = `GROUP BY` + `COUNT(*)`, `PROC FREQ`; [`most_common(n)`](https://docs.python.org/3/library/collections.html#collections.Counter.most_common); липсващ ключ дава 0; първо почистете ключа"

